---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Status"
  description="Extraction health per site and locale."
>
  <h1>Status</h1>
  <p>
    When Amazon changes their page layout, Verdict stops reading it correctly. This page tells
    you whether that has happened, before you have to wonder why a report looks wrong.
  </p>
  <p>
    Not live yet. The canary job that fills this table in runs from
    <span class="data">research/verdict_research/canary</span>, and that job has not shipped.
    Nothing below is real data.
  </p>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="register">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Site</th>
          <th>Locale</th>
          <th>Last verified</th>
          <th>Extraction health</th>
          <th>Rules version</th>
          <th>Median reviews extracted</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="6">No canary runs yet.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
</style>
